{{define "oidc-field-hint"}}{{if eq . "team-readers"}}Exact group names from the OIDC <code>groups</code> claim, not group email addresses. Grants read access to all available modules and this team's module and legacy usage pages; no management rights.{{else if eq . "team-reader-emails"}}Individual email addresses; OIDC must confirm <code>email_verified=true</code>. Grants read access to all available modules and this team's module and legacy usage pages; no management rights.{{else if eq . "team-admin-emails"}}Individual email addresses; OIDC must confirm <code>email_verified=true</code>. Grants administration of this team's access, tokens and local modules, including release approval; not global administration.{{else if eq . "team-admin-groups"}}Exact group names from the OIDC <code>groups</code> claim. Every matching member can administer this team's access, tokens and local modules, including release approval; not global administration.{{else if eq . "global-admin-groups"}}Exact group names from the OIDC <code>groups</code> claim. Every matching member becomes a global administrator of all teams, access settings and modules, including upstream modules.{{else if eq . "global-admin-emails"}}Individual email addresses; OIDC must confirm <code>email_verified=true</code>. Every match becomes a global administrator of the whole Forge service, not just one team.{{else if eq . "global-admin-subjects"}}Exact user identifiers from the OIDC <code>sub</code> claim, not email addresses or display names. Every match becomes a global administrator of the whole Forge service.{{end}} Enter one value per line.{{end}}
